### Proxy config (safe — not chaosed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/proxy/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Dev: forward to loopback boundary (appsettings.Development)
GET http://localhost:8080/proxy/api/v1/boundary/strings/xss-payloads
Accept: application/json

###

### Expect 403 when path would need a non-allowlisted host
# (Misconfigured UpstreamBaseUrl / empty AllowedHosts → 403 on all /proxy)

### Nested proxy recursion guard
GET http://localhost:8080/proxy/proxy/evil
Accept: application/json

###

### With chaos (optional): set 100% 500 then probe proxy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chaos/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latencyMs": 0,
  "error500Rate": 1,
  "corruptedJsonRate": 0
}

###

GET http://localhost:8080/proxy/api/v1/boundary/strings/xss-payloads
Accept: application/json

###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chaos/reset
Accept: application/json

###
